 <description>WCH CH32V002F4U6 RISC-V MCU, QFN20 3x3 mm / 0.4 mm pitch, 2.5-5 V, 12-bit ADC (8 channels), 18 I/O. Pin compatible with CH32V003F4U6 (10-bit ADC + OPA). Exposed pad EPAD (internally VSS) - route to GND.</description>
